      "rows": [
        [
          "5",
          "I think more cities will provide a free bus service for elderly people. Elderly people will\nbe able to go to the places necessary for their daily lives easily. I have two questions.\nHow many people are living in the city? Is there an amusement park in the city?"
        ],
        [
          "6",
          "Yes, I do. First, students can learn how to put their thoughts into words. By putting\ntheir thoughts into words, they can understand their own opinions better. Second,\nstudents who listen to others can also learn new ideas. These students can learn to\nunderstand a different way of thinking, even though they read the same book."
        ]
      ]
    },
